Subject: [PATCH 10/42] feat(amdgpu): stage validated code-object uploads

Add fixed-width code-object begin/chunk/commit routing and owner-scoped staging with CRC/SHA checks. Validate staged ELF identity, PT_LOAD and descriptor facts before commit while keeping A1 mapping and execution explicitly out of scope.

